{"3700510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vironics", "steam_appid": 3700510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a human operator in a space station controlling a Nanite body deployed to Earth to extract &amp; hack Nanites controlled by a Malicious AI that has taken control of Earth. Build and fortify your dropbase with advanced turrets and defenses then hold off waves of hostile robotic enemies while collecting nanites before extraction. The player must balance aggressive FPS action and strategic tower placement to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Against Waves of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/90669484f48b96bef20cfc4902356ecb.poster.avif?t=1770406107\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/90669484f48b96bef20cfc4902356ecb.webm?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/90669484f48b96bef20cfc4902356ecb.mp4?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold off waves of enemies to extract all the nanites in the area. Once all areas have been cleared endless mode becomes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Drop Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/6be86f736b0b01b287fdc5dcd61296ce.poster.avif?t=1770406107\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/6be86f736b0b01b287fdc5dcd61296ce.webm?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/6be86f736b0b01b287fdc5dcd61296ce.mp4?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in extract nanites, upgrade your base at the space station and do it all again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to spend your Nanites. Invest in turrets to create a fortified base that can hold on its own, or channel resources into powerful weapons and become a mobile turret yourself. Your strategy defines your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who are we?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 of us at Dragon Flame Games and instead of spending 7+ years making the game we have envisioned for the Vironics universe, we instead are releasing smaller complete games from the features that we need either way. It's our way of doing crowdfunding! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a human operator in a space station controlling a Nanite body deployed to Earth to extract &amp; hack Nanites controlled by a Malicious AI that has taken control of Earth. Build and fortify your dropbase with advanced turrets and defenses then hold off waves of hostile robotic enemies while collecting nanites before extraction. The player must balance aggressive FPS action and strategic tower placement to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Against Waves of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/90669484f48b96bef20cfc4902356ecb.poster.avif?t=1770406107\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/90669484f48b96bef20cfc4902356ecb.webm?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/90669484f48b96bef20cfc4902356ecb.mp4?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold off waves of enemies to extract all the nanites in the area. Once all areas have been cleared endless mode becomes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Drop Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/6be86f736b0b01b287fdc5dcd61296ce.poster.avif?t=1770406107\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/6be86f736b0b01b287fdc5dcd61296ce.webm?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/extras/6be86f736b0b01b287fdc5dcd61296ce.mp4?t=1770406107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in extract nanites, upgrade your base at the space station and do it all again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to spend your Nanites. Invest in turrets to create a fortified base that can hold on its own, or channel resources into powerful weapons and become a mobile turret yourself. Your strategy defines your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who are we?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 of us at Dragon Flame Games and instead of spending 7+ years making the game we have envisioned for the Vironics universe, we instead are releasing smaller complete games from the features that we need either way. It's our way of doing crowdfunding! </p>", "short_description": "Control a Nanite body from a space station to gather Nanite resources on Earth, seized by a rogue AI. Build and fortify your dropbase with turrets and defenses, fight waves of robotic enemies, and collect Nanites for extraction, balancing fast FPS combat with strategic tower placement.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/eb1e58d1cc5f08deeecefe0a5d4300e8d6407724/header.jpg?t=1770406107", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/552a28d63768649c5adcefa48aa3532eaf601dab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770406107", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700510/552a28d63768649c5adcefa48aa3532eaf601dab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770406107", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7-4790k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "©2025 Dragon Flame Games LLC. Developed by Dragon Flame Games LLC. Published by Dragon Flame Games LLC. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Dragon Flame Gam